<h3>8th edition of the NG-RES workshop</h3>
<h5>January 20, 2027 @ HiPEAC conference</h5>
<p style="text-align:justify">
The NG-RES workshop focuses on real-time embedded systems, with particular emphasis on the
distributed and parallel aspects.
The workshop is a venue for both the networking and multicore real-time communities aiming
at cross-fertilization and multi-disciplinary approaches to the design of embedded systems.
</p>

